& [Context]
  + the first exact debug workspace gate passed on the pre-review implementation
  + a cached exact-debug summary replay was then running while a contract review discovered that ordinary set deserialization silently collapsed duplicate supplied capability members

& [Fault]
  + the running summary replay no longer represented the exact current source after strict unique-set deserialization and its adversarial test were added

& [Correction]
  + explicitly interrupt and exclude the stale replay from closure evidence
  + run focused gates and both exact workspace profiles again only after the corrected tree is formatted and stable

& [Boundary]
  + no failure was hidden and no stale count is eligible for proof
  + the change strengthens the signed duplicate-identifier refusal requirement without widening runtime authority
